"The Primary is a powerful Artonan wizard known by his title; he is Stuart's father."
"He has long straight pale purple, nearly white hair, pink eyes and calloused hands."
"He wears no tablet, lens or iris rings, has multiple spouses and rarely socializes."
"He reads a leather-bound book at parties."
"At the LeafSong gala he measured Alden Thorn by holding his hands and questioning him."
"His magic is a cocoon far larger than Alden's, one that could erase him."
"He says he doesn't hurt people and calls Joe Ro-den."
"He told Alden he is too whole for the two of them to avoid one another in the long run."
"Joe seems afraid of him and says he will make Alden's life miserable once he learns Alden's skill."
"His sister, pregnant with babies, arranged his meeting with Alden."
